    <string name="ob_intro1_body">See how many watts your home is using right now, in the status bar, without opening an app.</string>
    <string name="ob_intro2_title">At a glance</string>
    <string name="ob_intro2_body">A home-screen widget shows today\'s electricity, gas and cost, and the price right now.</string>
    <string name="ob_intro3_title">Know when it matters</string>
    <string name="ob_intro3_body">Get a nudge when the gas is left on, usage stays high or electricity is cheap.</string>
